{"id":"s3.1.12","slug":"patterns","title":"Patterns","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Pattern problems require identifying the underlying rule of a sequence. There is no single trick, but it's useful to look for common patterns such as:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>Arithmetic/Geometric progressions:</strong> Check for a common difference or ratio.</li><li><strong>Powers:</strong> Look for squares, cubes, etc., possibly with an offset (e.g., $n^3 - 1$).</li><li><strong>Combinations of patterns:</strong> The sequence might be a sum of other sequences (e.g., $n^2 + (n-1)^2$).</li></ul><p>For example, in the sequence 0, 7, 26, 63, ..., each term is one less than a cube: $1^3-1, 2^3-1, 3^3-1, 4^3-1$. The next term is $5^3-1=124$.</p>","summary":"Pattern problems require identifying the underlying rule of a sequence.","generation_guideline":"Generate a number sequence and ask for the next term or a specific term in the sequence.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Find the next term of 48, 32, 24, 20, 18, ...:","answer":"17","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":2,"text":"Find the next term of 1, 4, 11, 26, 57, ...:","answer":"120","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":3,"text":"Find the next term of 1, 8, 21, 40, ...:","answer":"65","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":4,"text":"Find the next term of 0, 1, 5, 14, 30, 55, ...:","answer":"91","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":5,"text":"Find the next term of: 2, 9, 28, 65, 126, ...:","answer":"217","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":6,"text":"The next term of 1, 2, 6, 24, 120, ... is:","answer":"720","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":7,"text":"The next term of 2, 2, 4, 6, 10, 16, ... is:","answer":"26","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":8,"text":"Find the 9th term of 1, 2, 4, 8, ...:","answer":"256","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":9,"text":"Find the 10th term of: 2, 6, 12, 20, 30, ...:","answer":"110","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":10,"text":"Find the 100th term of 2, 6, 10, 14, 18, ...:","answer":"398","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":11,"text":"The 10th term of 2, 5, 10, 17, 26 ... is:","answer":"101","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":12,"text":"The next term of 1, 4, 10, 19, 31, ... is:","answer":"46","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":13,"text":"The 8th term of 2, 9, 28, 65, 126, ... is:","answer":"513","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":14,"text":"The 8th term of 0, 7, 26, 63, 124, ... is:","answer":"511","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":15,"text":"The next term of 1, 5, 6, 11, 17, 28, ... is:","answer":"45","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]},{"id":16,"text":"Find the next term of .0324, .054, .09, .15, ...:","answer":".25","kind":"exact","tags":["repeating-decimals","sequences"]}]}